<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of SAfrica shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of SAfrica shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net buyers of 153.336 million rand worth of South African shares last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			Week to Jan 24     Year to date    Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		1,040.886     3,145.120	 3,098.581</p>
<p>- sales			887.550     2,907.854	 2,609.729</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)  153.336	 237.266	   488.852</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE, and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>The JSE said it registered a record 42,467 deals on the exchange last week.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
